Version @SHORT_VERSION@ (build @BUILD_VERSION@), from source revision `@REVISION@`.

## This is a modified version

**logisim-evolved** is a modified version of
[**logisim-evolution**](https://github.com/logisim-evolution/logisim-evolution) — an
independent rewrite in Swift for macOS, begun on 4 September 2026 and still in progress. It
targets upstream release **4.1.0**.

It is **not** the original program, and it is neither endorsed by nor affiliated with the
logisim-evolution project or its developers. Bugs in this translation are not theirs.

*(GNU GPL version 3, section 5(a): prominent notice of modification, carrying a relevant date.)*

